Package: isomd5sum
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: isomd5sum-doc
Description: MD5 and SHA-256 checksum tools for ISO 9660 images
 isomd5sum provides tools to implant and verify MD5 or SHA-256 checksums
 in ISO 9660 images. The checksum is stored in the application data area
 of the ISO 9660 Primary Volume Descriptor, allowing integrity verification
 directly from the ISO file or from physical media.
 .
 This package contains the command-line tools: checkisomd5, implantisomd5,
 checkisosha, and implantisosha.

Package: isomd5sum-dev
Architecture: any
Section: libdevel
Depends: isomd5sum (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Development files for isomd5sum
 isomd5sum provides tools to implant and verify MD5 or SHA-256 checksums
 in ISO 9660 images.
 .
 This package contains the static libraries and C header files for
 developing applications that use the isomd5sum libraries.

Package: isomd5sum-doc
Architecture: all
Section: doc
Multi-Arch: foreign
Priority: optional
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Documentation for isomd5sum
 isomd5sum provides tools to implant and verify MD5 or SHA-256 checksums
 in ISO 9660 images.
 .
 This package contains the GNU info manual and supplementary documentation.
 It can be omitted to keep only the binaries by not installing this package
 or by using apt-get install --no-install-recommends isomd5sum.
